DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER - push and pull as one session\, 45 min. Rows\
 , pull-ups\, overhead press\, rear delts. Heavy\, 4-6 reps\, not hypertr
 ophy ranges. Free against the running and cycling load. Dead hangs 3 x m
 ax at the end - grip is a genuine weakness at 32-36 s.\n\nWeek 1 of 23 -
  Re-entry\nRE-ENTRY. Vertical jump comes back about 18 days after an ult
 ra\, which is Thursday\, so the running is all easy and the first box ju
 mps start low. Durability is the through-line of the whole block: long s
 essions over 90 min are what preserve running economy under fatigue\, wh
 ich is the 70.3 run leg in one sentence.\n159 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venic
 e-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
