SUMMARY:Strength UPPER\, 45 min
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER\, 45 min - rows\, pull-ups\, overhead press\, 
 rear delts\, 4-6 reps\, 3 sets. Dead hangs 3 x max at the end. No runnin
 g or riding today: Monday is the endurance rest day.\n\nWeek 2 of 23 - R
 e-entry\n5 KM RETEST Tuesday - it sets every run pace for the block. Fro
 m this week the rhythm is fixed: Mon upper (no endurance)\, Tue swim + r
 un quality\, Wed legs\, Thu bike quality + a short run off the bike\, Fr
 i swim + optional easy spin\, Sat long run + swim\, Sun long ride. Hard 
 days are Tue\, Thu\, Sat and Sun\; Mon and Wed carry no swim\, bike or r
 un.\n152 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
