DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261125
SUMMARY:≈ Swim 07:00 Sloterparkbad (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Swim 07:00 Sloterparkbad - 50 m pool\, lanes 07:00-08:00\, be
 fore work. CONTINUOUS 200 m. Warm-up 100 m + 10 bobs\, 10 min drills (si
 de kick\, catch-up). Main: 200 m without stopping\, easy. Breathe out th
 rough mouth and nose\, in through the mouth\, every 2nd stroke. Then 4 x
  50 m with 30 s rest. Cool-down 100 m. Can't hold it calmly? Swim it as 
 2-3 pieces with 30 s rest and repeat the target next week.\n\nWeek 2 of 
 23 - Re-entry\n5 KM RETEST Tuesday - it sets every run pace for the bloc
 k. From this week the rhythm is fixed: Mon upper (no endurance)\, Tue sw
 im + run quality\, Wed legs\, Thu bike quality + a short run off the bik
 e\, Fri swim + optional easy spin\, Sat long run + swim\, Sun long ride.
  Hard days are Tue\, Thu\, Sat and Sun\; Mon and Wed carry no swim\, bik
 e or run.\n151 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
