SUMMARY:5 KM RETEST (10 km)
DESCRIPTION:5 KM RETEST - flat\, out-and-back\, auto-pause OFF. Warm up 2
 0 min + 4-6 x 100 m AT goal pace\, no faster. First 400 m must not go un
 der target. This sets every run pace for the block.\n\nWeek 2 of 23 - Re
 -entry\n5 KM RETEST Tuesday - it sets every run pace for the block. From
  this week the rhythm is fixed: Mon upper (no endurance)\, Tue swim + ru
 n quality\, Wed legs\, Thu bike quality + a short run off the bike\, Fri
  swim + optional easy spin\, Sat long run + swim\, Sun long ride. Hard d
 ays are Tue\, Thu\, Sat and Sun\; Mon and Wed carry no swim\, bike or ru
 n.\n151 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
