DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261125
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261126
SUMMARY:◆ Strength LOWER (50 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength LOWER - HEAVY\, 50 min. Back squat 4 x 4 at 82.5 kg 
 if Friday's 80 kg moved well\, otherwise 80 kg\, safety pins on\; hack s
 quat if there's no rack. Within 2 min of each squat set: box jumps 3 x 5
  (20-inch box or the step\, step down). Then Bulgarian split squat 3 x 5
 /leg heavy\, Nordic curls 2 x 4\, single-leg calf raises 3 x 8 loaded\, 
 tibialis raises 3 x 15. Heavy 3-5 reps is what moves running and cycling
  economy\; light sets do not.\n\nWeek 2 of 23 - Re-entry\n5 KM RETEST Tu
 esday - it sets every run pace for the block. From this week the rhythm 
 is fixed: Mon upper (no endurance)\, Tue swim + run quality\, Wed legs\,
  Thu bike quality + a short run off the bike\, Fri swim + optional easy 
 spin\, Sat long run + swim\, Sun long ride. Hard days are Tue\, Thu\, Sa
 t and Sun\; Mon and Wed carry no swim\, bike or run.\n150 days to IRONMA
 N 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
