DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:○ BIKE QUALITY 45 min on Zwift
DESCRIPTION:BIKE QUALITY 45 min on Zwift - 2 x 8 min sweet spot (88-93% F
 TP\, about 163-172 W at FTP 185)\, 4 min easy between. Warm-up 10 min wi
 th 3 x 1 min at 100-110 rpm\, cool-down 5-10 min. Fan on\, a bottle per 
 hour.\n\nWeek 2 of 23 - Re-entry\n5 KM RETEST Tuesday - it sets every ru
 n pace for the block. From this week the rhythm is fixed: Mon upper (no 
 endurance)\, Tue swim + run quality\, Wed legs\, Thu bike quality + a sh
 ort run off the bike\, Fri swim + optional easy spin\, Sat long run + sw
 im\, Sun long ride. Hard days are Tue\, Thu\, Sat and Sun\; Mon and Wed 
 carry no swim\, bike or run.\n149 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
