SUMMARY:Run 10 min OFF THE BIKE\, straight after…
DESCRIPTION:Run 10 min OFF THE BIKE\, straight after Thursday's ride. Sho
 es by the trainer\, out the door within 5 min. The first minutes feel wr
 ong\; that is the adaptation. Easy\, HR under 158.\n\nWeek 2 of 23 - Re-
 entry\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\n5 KM RETEST Tuesd
 ay - it sets every run pace for the block. From this week the rhythm is 
 fixed: Mon upper (no endurance)\, Tue swim + run quality\, Wed legs\, Th
 u bike quality + a short run off the bike\, Fri swim + optional easy spi
 n\, Sat long run + swim\, Sun long ride. Hard days are Tue\, Thu\, Sat a
 nd Sun\; Mon and Wed carry no swim\, bike or run.\n149 days to IRONMAN 7
 0.3 Venice-Jesolo.
