DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:○ Long ride 1 h 15 (75 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 1 h 15 - zone 2 (56-75% FTP\, about 104-139 W\, HR 
 under 145)\, 85-95 rpm. Outdoors if it's dry and above about 5 C\, other
 wise Zwift. Fuel from 20 min: 40-60 g carb per hour.\n\nWeek 2 of 23 - R
 e-entry\n5 KM RETEST Tuesday - it sets every run pace for the block. Fro
 m this week the rhythm is fixed: Mon upper (no endurance)\, Tue swim + r
 un quality\, Wed legs\, Thu bike quality + a short run off the bike\, Fr
 i swim + optional easy spin\, Sat long run + swim\, Sun long ride. Hard 
