BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w3-s0-push@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:Strength UPPER\, 45 min
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER\, 45 min - rows\, pull-ups\, overhead press\, 
 rear delts\, 4-6 reps\, 3 sets. Dead hangs 3 x max at the end. No runnin
 g or riding today: Monday is the endurance rest day.\n\nWeek 3 of 23 - B
 ase 1\nBASE 1 (weeks 3-6): swim to 500 m continuous\, bike from about 2.
 5 to 4 h a week\, run 23-26 km. About 80% of the time is easy. For amate
 ur half-Ironman athletes\, threshold time is linked with faster races\, 
 so each week keeps one run and one bike session at threshold or sweet sp
 ot. Book the 6 swim lessons now (they start next week).\n145 days to IRO
 NMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
