DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:≈ Swim 07:00 Sloterparkbad (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Swim 07:00 Sloterparkbad - 50 m pool\, lanes 07:00-08:00\, be
 fore work. CONTINUOUS 300 m. Warm-up 100 m + 10 bobs\, 10 min drills (si
 de kick\, catch-up). Main: 300 m without stopping\, easy. Breathe out th
 rough mouth and nose\, in through the mouth\, every 2nd stroke. Then 4 x
  50 m drill-swim. Cool-down 100 m. Can't hold it calmly? Swim it as 2-3 
 pieces with 30 s rest and repeat the target next week.\n\nWeek 3 of 23 -
  Base 1\nBASE 1 (weeks 3-6): swim to 500 m continuous\, bike from about 
 2.5 to 4 h a week\, run 23-26 km. About 80% of the time is easy. For ama
 teur half-Ironman athletes\, threshold time is linked with faster races\
 , so each week keeps one run and one bike session at threshold or sweet 
 spot. Book the 6 swim lessons now (they start next week).\n144 days to I
 RONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
