DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:THRESHOLD 3 x 8 min (9 km)
DESCRIPTION:THRESHOLD 3 x 8 min - threshold effort (HR 175-181\, comforta
 bly hard\, about your 1-hour race effort)\, 2 min jog between. Warm-up 1
 5 min easy + 4 strides\, cool-down 10 min. Paces come from the 5 km rete
 st.\n\nWeek 3 of 23 - Base 1\nBASE 1 (weeks 3-6): swim to 500 m continuo
 us\, bike from about 2.5 to 4 h a week\, run 23-26 km. About 80% of the 
 time is easy. For amateur half-Ironman athletes\, threshold time is link
 ed with faster races\, so each week keeps one run and one bike session a
 t threshold or sweet spot. Book the 6 swim lessons now (they start next 
 week).\n144 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
