DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261202
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261203
SUMMARY:◆ Strength LOWER (50 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength LOWER - HEAVY\, 50 min. Back squat 4 x 3-5 at 85-90%
  1RM\, add 2.5 kg when the last set moves well\, safety pins on\; hack s
 quat if there's no rack. Within 2 min of each squat set: box jumps 3 x 5
  (20-inch box or the step\, step down). Then Bulgarian split squat 3 x 5
 /leg heavy\, Nordic curls 2 x 4\, single-leg calf raises 3 x 8 loaded\, 
 tibialis raises 3 x 15. Heavy 3-5 reps is what moves running and cycling
  economy\; light sets do not.\n\nWeek 3 of 23 - Base 1\nBASE 1 (weeks 3-
 6): swim to 500 m continuous\, bike from about 2.5 to 4 h a week\, run 2
 3-26 km. About 80% of the time is easy. For amateur half-Ironman athlete
 s\, threshold time is linked with faster races\, so each week keeps one 
 run and one bike session at threshold or sweet spot. Book the 6 swim les
 sons now (they start next week).\n143 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo
 .
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
