SUMMARY:Strength UPPER\, 45 min
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER\, 45 min - rows\, pull-ups\, overhead press\, 
 rear delts\, 4-6 reps\, 3 sets. Dead hangs 3 x max at the end. No runnin
 g or riding today: Monday is the endurance rest day.\n\nWeek 4 of 23 - B
 ase 1\nSwim lesson 1 this week. A coach fixes the stroke before the volu
 me arrives\; adult-onset swimmers struggle to feel their own body positi
 on\, which is exactly what a filmed lesson shows.\n138 days to IRONMAN 7
 0.3 Venice-Jesolo.
