SUMMARY:≈ Swim 07:00 Sloterparkbad (45 min)
DESCRIPTION:Swim 07:00 Sloterparkbad - 50 m pool\, lanes 07:00-08:00\, be
 fore work. CONTINUOUS 400 m. Warm-up 100 m + 10 bobs\, 10 min drills (si
 de kick\, catch-up). Main: 400 m without stopping\, easy. Breathe out th
 rough mouth and nose\, in through the mouth\, every 2nd stroke. Then 4 x
  50 m with 20 s rest. Cool-down 100 m. Can't hold it calmly? Swim it as 
 2-3 pieces with 30 s rest and repeat the target next week.\n\nWeek 4 of 
 23 - Base 1\nSwim lesson 1 this week. A coach fixes the stroke before th
 e volume arrives\; adult-onset swimmers struggle to feel their own body 
 position\, which is exactly what a filmed lesson shows.\n137 days to IRO
 NMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
