SUMMARY:◆ Strength LOWER (50 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength LOWER - HEAVY\, 50 min. Back squat 3 x 3 at last wee
 k's weight - fewer sets\, same load (down week)\, safety pins on\; hack 
 squat if there's no rack. Within 2 min of each squat set: box jumps 3 x 
 5 + pogo hops 2 x 15. Then Bulgarian split squat 3 x 5/leg heavy\, Nordi
 c curls 2 x 4\, single-leg calf raises 3 x 8 loaded\, tibialis raises 3 
 x 15. Heavy 3-5 reps is what moves running and cycling economy\; light s
 ets do not.\n\nWeek 6 of 23 - Base 1\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add v
 olume.\nDOWN WEEK + Christmas. Volume about 30% lower\, intensity kept b
 ut short. Pools run holiday hours and are usually closed on Christmas Da
