 FTP\, about 176-185 W)\, 4 min easy between. Warm-up 10 min with 3 x 1 m
 in at 100-110 rpm\, cool-down 5-10 min. Fan on\, a bottle per hour.\n\nW
 eek 11 of 23 - Base 2\n5 KM RETEST Tuesday resets the run paces for the 
 race block. Longest base ride Sunday\, 2 h 45 + 15 min run: outdoors if 
 it's dry\, otherwise Zwift. The 90 km race bike is over half your race t
 ime\, so this is the ride that matters most.\n86 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Ve
 nice-Jesolo.
