SUMMARY:Strength UPPER\, 45 min
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER\, 45 min - rows\, pull-ups\, overhead press\, 
 rear delts\, 4-6 reps\, 3 sets. Dead hangs 3 x max at the end. No runnin
 g or riding today: Monday is the endurance rest day.\n\nWeek 12 of 23 - 
 Pre-Ramadan\nLAST FED WEEK BEFORE RAMADAN. ADMIN: (1) book the certifica
 to medico agonistico - Italy requires an ECG-based sports medical on the
  FITRI form\, and without it you are not issued a race pack. (2) Thursda
 y is a RAMP TEST retest: the result rescales every watt for the race blo
 ck. (3) RAMADAN starts about Mon 8 Feb\, and weeks 15-18 are in Abu Dhab
 i (22 Feb - 20 Mar). Four short swims this week - frequency beats volume
  for motor learning. CUT ORDER if life gets busy: (1) the Friday ride\, 
 (2) the fourth swim\, (3) Monday upper. Never cut the long ride\, the lo
 ng run\, or below three swims.\n82 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
