UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w12-s4-legs@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270203
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270204
SUMMARY:◆ Strength LOWER (50 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength LOWER - HEAVY\, 50 min. Back squat 4 x 3-5 at 85-90%
  1RM\, add 2.5 kg when the last set moves well\, safety pins on\; hack s
 quat if there's no rack. Within 2 min of each squat set: depth jumps 3 x
  5 (step off the Les Mills step\, straight onto the 20-inch box) + pogo 
 hops 2 x 15. Then Bulgarian split squat 3 x 5/leg heavy\, Nordic curls 2
  x 4\, single-leg calf raises 3 x 8 loaded\, tibialis raises 3 x 15. Hea
 vy 3-5 reps is what moves running and cycling economy\; light sets do no
 t.\n\nWeek 12 of 23 - Pre-Ramadan\nLAST FED WEEK BEFORE RAMADAN. ADMIN: 
 (1) book the certificato medico agonistico - Italy requires an ECG-based
  sports medical on the FITRI form\, and without it you are not issued a 
 race pack. (2) Thursday is a RAMP TEST retest: the result rescales every
  watt for the race block. (3) RAMADAN starts about Mon 8 Feb\, and weeks
  15-18 are in Abu Dhabi (22 Feb - 20 Mar). Four short swims this week - 
 frequency beats volume for motor learning. CUT ORDER if life gets busy: 
 (1) the Friday ride\, (2) the fourth swim\, (3) Monday upper. Never cut 
 the long ride\, the long run\, or below three swims.\n80 days to IRONMAN
  70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
