BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w13-s0-swim@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270210
SUMMARY:≈ Swim at Het Marnix\, 35 min before iftar
DESCRIPTION:Swim at Het Marnix\, 35 min before iftar - 1200 m continuous\
 , easy. Tuesday lanes close 16:30\, so 15:45-16:30\; iftar is about 17:4
 5. Fasted: no sprints.\n\nWeek 13 of 23 - Ramadan\nRAMADAN STARTS about 
 Mon 8 Feb (the moon sighting can move it a day). Weeks 13-17 follow the 
 fast: hard and long sessions after iftar (light iftar\, start 60-90 min 
 later)\, short easy swims only in the last 1-2 hours before iftar\, noth
 ing hard and nothing over 60 min while fasted. Monday is a full rest day
  and the Friday zone-2 ride goes. HR runs higher at the same pace when y
 ou are dry - run by effort. First brick on Saturday: start the run withi
 n 5 minutes of racking the bike\; the first 10 min feel wrong and it nor
 malises by km 3. Get the bike fit done before Abu Dhabi: saddle height a
 nd cleat alignment are named ITBS contributors.\n74 days to IRONMAN 70.3
  Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
