 rep fewer than planned\, same pace.\n\nWeek 13 of 23 - Ramadan\nRAMADAN 
 STARTS about Mon 8 Feb (the moon sighting can move it a day). Weeks 13-1
 7 follow the fast: hard and long sessions after iftar (light iftar\, sta
 rt 60-90 min later)\, short easy swims only in the last 1-2 hours before
  iftar\, nothing hard and nothing over 60 min while fasted. Monday is a 
 full rest day and the Friday zone-2 ride goes. HR runs higher at the sam
 e pace when you are dry - run by effort. First brick on Saturday: start 
 the run within 5 minutes of racking the bike\; the first 10 min feel wro
 ng and it normalises by km 3. Get the bike fit done before Abu Dhabi: sa
 ddle height and cleat alignment are named ITBS contributors.\n74 days to
  IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
