 n\nWeek 13 of 23 - Ramadan\nRAMADAN STARTS about Mon 8 Feb (the moon sig
 hting can move it a day). Weeks 13-17 follow the fast: hard and long ses
 sions after iftar (light iftar\, start 60-90 min later)\, short easy swi
 ms only in the last 1-2 hours before iftar\, nothing hard and nothing ov
 er 60 min while fasted. Monday is a full rest day and the Friday zone-2 
 ride goes. HR runs higher at the same pace when you are dry - run by eff
 ort. First brick on Saturday: start the run within 5 minutes of racking 
 the bike\; the first 10 min feel wrong and it normalises by km 3. Get th
 e bike fit done before Abu Dhabi: saddle height and cleat alignment are 
 named ITBS contributors.\n73 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
