BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w13-s3-legs@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270211
SUMMARY:◆ Legs
DESCRIPTION:Legs - maintenance + glute-med\, 30 min after iftar\, before 
 the 21:00 swim. LOWER-LEG AND FOOT\, about 5 min at the end: tibialis an
 terior raises 3 x 15-20 (heels on a step\, toes lifting)\, heel walks 2 
 x 20 m\, eccentric dorsiflexion 3 x 10 slow against a band\, short-foot 
 holds 3 x 30 s per side\, tennis ball under the arch 60 s. An 8-week RCT
  in amateur runners raised lactate threshold velocity 5.9% with intrinsi
 c foot work - but that was 30 min DAILY\, so treat this as maintaining t
 he tissue that failed on 7 Sep\, not as a 5.9% gain.\n\nWeek 13 of 23 - 
 Ramadan\nRAMADAN STARTS about Mon 8 Feb (the moon sighting can move it a
  day). Weeks 13-17 follow the fast: hard and long sessions after iftar (
 light iftar\, start 60-90 min later)\, short easy swims only in the last
  1-2 hours before iftar\, nothing hard and nothing over 60 min while fas
 ted. Monday is a full rest day and the Friday zone-2 ride goes. HR runs 
 higher at the same pace when you are dry - run by effort. First brick on
  Saturday: start the run within 5 minutes of racking the bike\; the firs
 t 10 min feel wrong and it normalises by km 3. Get the bike fit done bef
 ore Abu Dhabi: saddle height and cleat alignment are named ITBS contribu
 tors.\n73 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
