BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w14-s0-swim@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270216
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270217
SUMMARY:≈ Swim at Het Marnix\, 40 min before iftar
DESCRIPTION:Swim at Het Marnix\, 40 min before iftar - 1400 m continuous\
 , easy. Tuesday lanes close 16:30\; iftar about 17:55. Fasted: no sprint
 s.\n\nWeek 14 of 23 - Ramadan\nBuy the wetsuit now. Buy for BUOYANCY not
  speed - beginner suits run 5 mm through core/hips/legs\, which directly
  fixes the sinking-legs problem. Wetsuits give the biggest gain to ineff
 icient low-buoyancy swimmers\, i.e. you: 5-11%\, roughly 2-4 min over 1.
 9 km. Also buy neoprene BOOTIES - legal below 18.3 C and the water will 
 be 15-17 C. ABU DHABI PREP: book Etihad if it is not done (a boxed bike 
 travels in the checked-bag allowance - check the weight)\, get a bike bo
 x\, and buy a spare Cube derailleur hanger to pack with it.\n67 days to 
 IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
