BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w15-s0-swim@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270223
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270224
SUMMARY:≈ Pool swim 30 min before iftar
DESCRIPTION:Pool swim 30 min before iftar - easy\, loosen up after the fl
 ight.\n\nWeek 15 of 23 - Ramadan\nABU DHABI from Mon 22 Feb - the flight
  day is a rest day. Iftar there is about 18:20\, so night sessions start
  about 19:30. Al Wathba cycle track is floodlit and open all night\; the
  sea is 21-23 C. Sea swims only on a lifeguarded beach\, with a tow buoy
 \, never alone. GUT TRAINING STARTS - 8-12 weeks out is the window. Targ
 et 60-70 g carb/h on the bike\, NOT 90: measured exogenous glucose oxida
 tion is 33 g/h under 70 kg vs 45 g/h above it. At 56 kg your ceiling is 
 genuinely lower. Fuel every session over 75 min\, +10-15 g/h every 1-2 w
 eeks\, and use the exact race products (Maurten\, Precision PH 1000). In
  Ramadan the night rides carry it: drink with iftar\, start 60-90 min la
 ter\, fuel from the first 20 min.\n60 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo
 .
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
