  night sessions start about 19:30. Al Wathba cycle track is floodlit and
  open all night\; the sea is 21-23 C. Sea swims only on a lifeguarded be
 ach\, with a tow buoy\, never alone. GUT TRAINING STARTS - 8-12 weeks ou
 t is the window. Target 60-70 g carb/h on the bike\, NOT 90: measured ex
 ogenous glucose oxidation is 33 g/h under 70 kg vs 45 g/h above it. At 5
 6 kg your ceiling is genuinely lower. Fuel every session over 75 min\, +
 10-15 g/h every 1-2 weeks\, and use the exact race products (Maurten\, P
 recision PH 1000). In Ramadan the night rides carry it: drink with iftar
 \, start 60-90 min later\, fuel from the first 20 min.\n60 days to IRONM
 AN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
