 one. GUT TRAINING STARTS - 8-12 weeks out is the window. Target 60-70 g 
 carb/h on the bike\, NOT 90: measured exogenous glucose oxidation is 33 
 g/h under 70 kg vs 45 g/h above it. At 56 kg your ceiling is genuinely l
 ower. Fuel every session over 75 min\, +10-15 g/h every 1-2 weeks\, and 
 use the exact race products (Maurten\, Precision PH 1000). In Ramadan th
 e night rides carry it: drink with iftar\, start 60-90 min later\, fuel 
 from the first 20 min.\n58 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
