SUMMARY:≈ Swim 35 min easy\, pool or sea
DESCRIPTION:Swim 35 min easy\, pool or sea.\n\nWeek 18 of 23 - Abu Dhabi\
 nLast Abu Dhabi week and the first fully fed one - the big week. You fly
  home Sat 20 Mar\, so the brick moves to Thursday. TARGET: 1900 m contin
 uous. The cutoff needs only 3:41/100 m and ANY STROKE IS LEGAL - breasts
 troke the whole thing is permitted\, and you may hold a buoy or kayak to
  rest provided you make no forward progress. Knowing that is what stops 
 the panic that actually causes swim DNFs.\n36 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venic
 e-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
