 t.\n\nWeek 18 of 23 - Abu Dhabi\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Tal
 k test.\nLast Abu Dhabi week and the first fully fed one - the big week.
  You fly home Sat 20 Mar\, so the brick moves to Thursday. TARGET: 1900 
 m continuous. The cutoff needs only 3:41/100 m and ANY STROKE IS LEGAL -
  breaststroke the whole thing is permitted\, and you may hold a buoy or 
 kayak to rest provided you make no forward progress. Knowing that is wha
 t stops the panic that actually causes swim DNFs.\n36 days to IRONMAN 70
 .3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
