SUMMARY:○ Long ride 80 km steady at IF 0.68-0.72 (180 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 80 km steady at IF 0.68-0.72 (126-133 W)\, the day 
 after the flight home. Amsterdam is about 15 C colder than Abu Dhabi\, s
 o dress for it\; if the flight wrecked your sleep\, ride it Monday inste
 ad.\n\nWeek 18 of 23 - Abu Dhabi\nLast Abu Dhabi week and the first full
 y fed one - the big week. You fly home Sat 20 Mar\, so the brick moves t
 o Thursday. TARGET: 1900 m continuous. The cutoff needs only 3:41/100 m 
 and ANY STROKE IS LEGAL - breaststroke the whole thing is permitted\, an
 d you may hold a buoy or kayak to rest provided you make no forward prog
 ress. Knowing that is what stops the panic that actually causes swim DNF
 s.\n34 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
