SUMMARY:Strength UPPER\, 30 min\, optional
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER\, 30 min\, optional - pull-ups\, rows\, press\
 , 2 sets. Keep it short\; the endurance work is the priority now.\n\nWee
 k 20 of 23 - Build\nOPEN WATER STARTS - the single highest-consequence i
 tem in this plan. 90 of 120 sudden deaths in US triathlon occurred in th
 e swim\, and the mechanism is cold-water panic\, not fitness. You should
  already have done 5-6 cold immersions over the winter\; this is where i
 t gets applied in a wetsuit.\n26 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
