SUMMARY:≈ OPEN WATER 30-40 min in wetsuit + booties
DESCRIPTION:OPEN WATER 30-40 min in wetsuit + booties. Sight every 6-10 s
 trokes. Rehearse the bail-out: roll to back\, float\, breathe\, restart.
  Dutch water is about 10-13 C in April: only with an organised group or 
 a buddy who is watching\, wetsuit + booties + 2 caps\, 10-20 min at firs
 t. No group available? Do it as a wetsuit swim in the pool.\n\nWeek 20 o
 f 23 - Build\nOPEN WATER STARTS - the single highest-consequence item in
  this plan. 90 of 120 sudden deaths in US triathlon occurred in the swim
 \, and the mechanism is cold-water panic\, not fitness. You should alrea
 dy have done 5-6 cold immersions over the winter\; this is where it gets
  applied in a wetsuit.\n25 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
