SUMMARY:Strength UPPER\, 30 min\, optional
DESCRIPTION:Strength UPPER\, 30 min\, optional - pull-ups\, rows\, press\
 , 2 sets. Keep it short\; the endurance work is the priority now.\n\nWee
 k 21 of 23 - Build\nFull dress rehearsal. Run plan is RUN/WALK from km 0
 \, not as a fallback: 9 min run / 1 min walk blends to ~7:24/km and beat
 s an even-paced blow-up by minutes per km. The course gives you 3 loops 
 x 7.03 km with 9 aid stations - walk every one\, 5-15 s\, 3-5 good gulps
 .\n19 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
