BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w21-s4-legs@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270407
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270408
SUMMARY:◆ Legs (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:Legs - MAINTENANCE\, 30 min. Back squat 2 x 3 at about 85% of
  your best set\, Bulgarian split squat 2 x 5/leg\, single-leg calf raise
 s 2 x 8\, tibialis raises 2 x 15. One heavy session a week holds the win
 ter's strength through the race block.\n\nWeek 21 of 23 - Build\nFull dr
 ess rehearsal. Run plan is RUN/WALK from km 0\, not as a fallback: 9 min
  run / 1 min walk blends to ~7:24/km and beats an even-paced blow-up by 
 minutes per km. The course gives you 3 loops x 7.03 km with 9 aid statio
 ns - walk every one\, 5-15 s\, 3-5 good gulps.\n17 days to IRONMAN 70.3 
 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ironman703venicejesolo-w21-s5-cycling@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20261115T164533Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270408
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270409
SUMMARY:○ BIKE QUALITY 60-75 min
DESCRIPTION:BIKE QUALITY 60-75 min - 3 x 12 min at sweet spot (88-93% FTP
 \, about 163-172 W at FTP 185)\, 5 min easy spin between. Warm up 15 min
 . The 90 km bike is over half of a 70.3 by time and this is the session 
 that builds it.\n\nWeek 21 of 23 - Build\nFull dress rehearsal. Run plan
  is RUN/WALK from km 0\, not as a fallback: 9 min run / 1 min walk blend
 s to ~7:24/km and beats an even-paced blow-up by minutes per km. The cou
 rse gives you 3 loops x 7.03 km with 9 aid stations - walk every one\, 5
 -15 s\, 3-5 good gulps.\n16 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
