DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270409
SUMMARY:Easy run 5 km OFF THE BIKE
DESCRIPTION:Easy run 5 km OFF THE BIKE - mini-brick. Run the first 10 min
  20-30 s/km slower than feels right\; the legs come good after that. Thi
 rd run of the week\, genuinely easy.\n\nWeek 21 of 23 - Build\nKeep HR u
 nder 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nFull dress rehearsal. Run plan is
  RUN/WALK from km 0\, not as a fallback: 9 min run / 1 min walk blends t
 o ~7:24/km and beats an even-paced blow-up by minutes per km. The course
  gives you 3 loops x 7.03 km with 9 aid stations - walk every one\, 5-15
  s\, 3-5 good gulps.\n16 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
