DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270414
SUMMARY:≈ OPEN WATER 30 min
DESCRIPTION:OPEN WATER 30 min - final cold exposure. Dutch water is about
  10-13 C in April: only with an organised group or a buddy who is watchi
 ng\, wetsuit + booties + 2 caps\, 10-20 min at first. No group available
 ? Do it as a wetsuit swim in the pool.\n\nWeek 22 of 23 - Taper\nTaper: 
 volume down 30-50%\, intensity retained\, swim FREQUENCY untouched. Carb
  load the day before is 8-12 g/kg = 450-670 g - that is a lot of food fo
 r 56 kg and it must be rehearsed\, not improvised.\n11 days to IRONMAN 7
 0.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
